# This directory stores raw TradingView webhook payloads archived by the
# /webhooks/tradingview/archive endpoint.
#
# Each file is named: {strategy_id}__{release_version}__{utc_timestamp}.json
#
# Files are committed automatically by the GitHub Action at:
#   .github/workflows/commit_webhook_ingest.yml
#
# Do not edit or delete files in this directory manually.
# They are the single source of truth for raw ingest history.
